{"text": "I cannot breathe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Get me out of here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not panic, Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Travis. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Turn around. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And walk quietly back to the machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Eckels turned around. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And started to run. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was so terrified. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That he left the path by accident. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Eckels, shouted Travis. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not leave the path. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The T, rex heard Travis. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And turned its head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Toward him and the other travelers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a moment of silence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then it suddenly started to run toward them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a loud roar. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Run, everybody, Run. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Shouted Travis.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", " ", "c", "a", "n", "n", "o", "t", " ", "b", "r", "e", "a", "t", "h", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "a", "i", "d", " ", "E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "G", "e", "t", " ", "m", "e", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "e", "r", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "o", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "p", "a", "n", "i", "c", ",", " ", "E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "a", "i", "d", " ", "T", "r", "a", "v", "i", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">",